/events/7795100349","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":"1d8833a9c1ada64cfc716109a8836b32cb8a9bd6","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/commits/1d8833a9c1ada64cfc716109a8836b32cb8a9bd6","created_at":"2022-11-11T21:31:20Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/1312498810","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/8790#issuecomment-1312498810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/8790","id":1312498810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX5JB85OOyR6","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-12T14:51:20Z","updated_at":"2022-11-12T14:51:20Z","body":"it's important to note that the big \"exponentiality\" here is in number of columns.    Each column added to the query, adds the whole annotations thing all over again, which in turn they all have the larger number of columns within.     I'm doing some htop tests and you need to add a few dozen columns to these models to see the bigger memory differences.\r\n\r\njust for posterity here's a mem test I'm running\r\n\r\n```py\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Column, literal_column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Integer\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import select\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import String, create_engine\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import ConcreteBase\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import aliased, Session\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import declarative_base\r\n\r\nBase = declarative_base()\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Employee(ConcreteBase, Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"employee\"\r\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n    name = Column(String(50))\r\n\r\n    x1 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x2 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x3 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x4 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x5 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x6 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x7 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x8 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x9 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x10 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x11 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x12 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x13 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x14 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x15 = Column(Integer)\r\n    x16 = Column(Integer)\r\n\r\n    __mapper_args__ = {\r\n        \"polymorphic_identity\": \"employee\",\r\n        \"concrete\": True,\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Manager(Employee):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"manager\"\r\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n    name = Column(String(50))\r\n    manager_data = Column(String(40))\r\n\r\n    m1 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m2 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m3 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m4 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m5 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m6 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m7 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m8 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m9 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m10 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m11 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m12 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m13 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m14 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m15 = Column(Integer)\r\n    m16 = Column(Integer)\r\n\r\n    __mapper_args__ = {\r\n        \"polymorphic_identity\": \"manager\",\r\n        \"concrete\": True,\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Engineer(Employee):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"engineer\"\r\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n    name = Column(String(50))\r\n    engineer_info = Column(String(40))\r\n\r\n    e1 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e2 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e3 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e4 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e5 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e6 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e7 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e8 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e9 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e10 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e11 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e12 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e13 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e14 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e15 = Column(Integer)\r\n    e16 = Column(Integer)\r\n\r\n    __mapper_args__ = {\r\n        \"polymorphic_identity\": \"engineer\",\r\n        \"concrete\": True,\r\n    }\r\n\r\nBase.registry.configure()\r\n\r\ne = create_engine(\"sqlite://\")\r\nBase.metadata.create_all(e)\r\n\r\nsession = Session(e)\r\n\r\nwhile True:\r\n    for i in range(100):\r\n        e1 = aliased(Employee)\r\n        e2 = aliased(Employee)\r\n\r\n        subq = select(e1).union_all(select(e2)).subquery()\r\n\r\n        anno = aliased(Employee, subq)\r\n\r\n        stmt = select(anno)\r\n        stmt = stmt.where(anno.name == literal_column(\"'harcoded name %d'\" % i))\r\n\r\n        session.execute(stmt)\r\n```\r\n\r\nusing htop, i have data like this for different numbers of columns (above is 56 cols):\r\n\r\n```\r\n8 columns\r\n\r\n1.4.43 w cache:   283M  67Mres\r\n1.4.43 no cache:  255M  38Mres\r\n\r\n1.4.44 w cache:  277M  61Mres   .02 variance \r\n1.4.44 no cache:  255M  38Mres   \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n24 columns\r\n\r\n1.4.43 w cache:   336M  118M res  \r\n1.4.43 no cache:  265M  49M res\r\n\r\n1.4.44 w cache:  323M  105M res    .03 variance\r\n1.4.44 no cache:  265M  48M res\r\n\r\n\r\n56 columns\r\n\r\n1.4.43 w cache:  416M 193M   \r\n1.4.43 no cache: \r\n\r\n1.4.44 w cache:  384M 154M  .07 variance\r\n1.4.44 no cache:  \r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/1312498810/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"pu